  "text": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_blobs\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n\ndef kmeans(X, k, n_iter=100, seed=0):\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    centers = X[rng.choice(len(X), size=k, replace=False)]     # старт: k случайных объектов\n    for it in range(n_iter):\n        # шаг 1: каждый объект — к ближайшему центру\n        dist = ((X[:, None, :] - centers[None, :, :]) ** 2).sum(axis=2)\n        labels = dist.argmin(axis=1)\n        # шаг 2: центр — среднее своих объектов\n        new = np.array([X[labels == j].mean(axis=0) for j in range(k)])\n        if np.allclose(new, centers):\n            break\n        centers = new\n    inertia = ((X - centers[labels]) ** 2).sum()\n    return centers, labels, inertia, it + 1\n\nX, y = make_blobs(n_samples=600, centers=6, cluster_std=0.8, random_state=0)\nfor seed in range(5):\n    c, lab, inertia, iters = kmeans(X, 6, seed=seed)\n    print(f'старт {seed}: итераций {iters:2d}, инерция {inertia:8.1f}')\n\nsk = KMeans(n_clusters=6, n_init=10, random_state=0).fit(X)\nprint(f'sklearn (k-means++, 10 запусков): инерция {sk.inertia_:.1f}')",
